From: appkins <nbatkins@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 31 Aug 2026 22:30:00 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] UefiPayloadPkg: build all three USB CDC network class drivers

The RPi5 convention, ported verbatim: NCM and RNDIS join ECM so the
gadget mode stays the BMC's choice. The JetKVM presents CDC-ECM; the
nanokvm BMC presents CDC-NCM (ncm.usb0). All three ride the shared
NetworkCommon UNDI, so the sticky-media patch (0019) and the MAC-matched
discovery cover every mode without further change.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [platform policy]

---

diff --git aa/UefiPayloadPkg/UefiPayloadPkg.dsc bb/UefiPayloadPkg/UefiPayloadPkg.dsc
--- aa/UefiPayloadPkg/UefiPayloadPkg.dsc
+++ bb/UefiPayloadPkg/UefiPayloadPkg.dsc
@@ -1100,6 +1100,9 @@
   #
   MdeModulePkg/Bus/Usb/UsbNetwork/NetworkCommon/NetworkCommon.inf
   MdeModulePkg/Bus/Usb/UsbNetwork/UsbCdcEcm/UsbCdcEcm.inf
+  MdeModulePkg/Bus/Usb/UsbNetwork/UsbCdcNcm/UsbCdcNcm.inf
+  MdeModulePkg/Bus/Usb/UsbNetwork/UsbRndis/UsbRndis.inf
+  MdeModulePkg/Bus/Usb/UsbNetwork/UsbCdcEem/UsbCdcEem.inf
   #
   # The host-side consumer of EDKII_REDFISH_CONFIG_HANDLER_PROTOCOL. Stock
   # RedfishPlatformConfigDxe (above) is what answers for HII.
diff --git aa/UefiPayloadPkg/UefiPayloadPkg.fdf bb/UefiPayloadPkg/UefiPayloadPkg.fdf
--- aa/UefiPayloadPkg/UefiPayloadPkg.fdf
+++ bb/UefiPayloadPkg/UefiPayloadPkg.fdf
@@ -394,6 +394,9 @@ INF MdeModulePkg/Application/BootManagerMenuApp/BootManagerMenuApp.inf
   !include RedfishPkg/Redfish.fdf.inc
   INF MdeModulePkg/Bus/Usb/UsbNetwork/NetworkCommon/NetworkCommon.inf
   INF MdeModulePkg/Bus/Usb/UsbNetwork/UsbCdcEcm/UsbCdcEcm.inf
+  INF MdeModulePkg/Bus/Usb/UsbNetwork/UsbCdcNcm/UsbCdcNcm.inf
+  INF MdeModulePkg/Bus/Usb/UsbNetwork/UsbRndis/UsbRndis.inf
+  INF MdeModulePkg/Bus/Usb/UsbNetwork/UsbCdcEem/UsbCdcEem.inf
   INF NucRedfishPkg/NucRedfishSyncDxe/NucRedfishSyncDxe.inf
   INF NucRedfishPkg/EthConfigDxe/EthConfigDxe.inf
 !if $(REDFISH_CLIENT) == TRUE
